{"ref":"BDB, עֹ֫צֶם","hw":"עֹ֫צֶם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֹ֫צֶם</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>might, bones</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>might</em>, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ יָדִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 8:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.8.17\">Dt 8:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ יָֽדְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 30:21\" href=\"/Job.30.21\">Jb 30:21</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָצְמָהֿ</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:9\" href=\"/Nahum.3.9\">Na 3:9</a> (Ges<sup>§ 91 e</sup>); + <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּע׳ רוּחוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.15\">Is 11:15</a> (Thes al.; for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּעְיָם ר׳</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>bones</em> (coll.): sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָצְמִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 139:15\" href=\"/Psalms.139.15\">ψ 139:15</a> = <em>my frame</em>.","next":"BDB, עָצְמָה","prev":"BDB, עָצֹם"}